---
/** Price: a plan's name over its price: a small currency mark hung from the top of large figures, and a quiet period on their baseline. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:176px; padding:18px 18px 20px; --gap:16px">
  <span class="cover-stack"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:48px"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:112px"></i></span>
  <span class="cover-line" style="align-items:flex-end; --gap:5px">
    <i class="cover-bar" style="align-self:flex-start; width:8px; height:10px; border-radius:3px"></i>
    <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:52px; height:30px; border-radius:8px"></i>
    <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-faint" style="width:44px; margin-bottom:3px"></i>
  </span>
</span>
